WEBVTT

00:24:27.917 --> 00:24:30.375
that I paid for something
that was not a taco?

00:24:31.458 --> 00:24:34.476
Anthony: Hm, well, you know,
I am running a business.

00:24:34.500 --> 00:24:37.018
I definitely want to make you happy.

00:24:37.042 --> 00:24:39.518
I can definitely
give you this for a discount.

00:24:39.542 --> 00:24:42.018
We're actually running a discount today

00:24:42.042 --> 00:24:43.309
for packs like these.

00:24:43.333 --> 00:24:47.393
They're gonna be 4 dollars off today.

00:24:47.417 --> 00:24:49.643
AG: I was hoping
to get both of these free.

00:24:49.667 --> 00:24:53.184
Is there anything I could offer you
that would make that worth your while?

00:24:53.208 --> 00:24:54.875
Anthony: Hm, well, what do you do?

00:24:55.792 --> 00:24:57.393
AG: Going into that negotiation,

00:24:57.417 --> 00:24:59.934
I was thinking about something
many people overlook.

00:24:59.958 --> 00:25:03.143
Negotiating is not
the first phase of making a deal.